85->        }\n386->        String msg = this.checkStatus(headerIdList, tmsLoanAccounts, firstAudit);\n387->        if (StringUtils.isNotBlank(msg)) {\n388->            return JsonResult.failJsonResult(msg);\n389->        }\n390->\n391->        // 区分初审&复审操作\n392->        if (firstAudit) {\n393->            // 初审操作，看那些类型需要复审\n394->            List<FndFlexValueDTO> flexValueDTOS = fndFlexValueApi.selectByType(TMS_REGISTERED_CAPITAL);\n395->            List<String> reviewAuditCode = Lists.newArrayList();\n396->            if (CollectionUtils.isNotEmpty(flexValueDTOS)) {\n397->                reviewAuditCode = flexValueDTOS.stream().map(FndFlexValueDTO::getCode).collect(Collectors.toList());\n398->            }\n399->            List<TmsLoanAccount> firstAuditList = Lists.newArrayList();\n400->            List<TmsLoanAccount> finalAuditList = Lists.newArrayList();\n401->            for (TmsLoanAccount loanAccount : tmsLoanAccounts) {\n402->                if (reviewAuditCode.contains(loanAccount.getTrxType())) {\n403->                    firstAuditList.add(loanAccount);\n404->                } else {\n405->                    finalAuditList.add(loanAccount);\n406->                }\n407->            }\n408->            this.firstAudit(firstAuditList, queryDTO);\n409->            this.finalAudit(finalAuditList, queryDTO, true);\n410->\n411->        } else {\n412->            // 最终审核完成\n413->            this.finalAudit(tmsLoanAccounts, queryDTO, true);\n414->        }\n415->\n416->        return JsonResult.okJsonResultWithData(\"操作成功\");\n417->    }\n418->\n419->    /**\n420->     * 校验操作单据状态\n421->     *\n422->     * @param headerIdList\n423->     * @param tmsLoanAccounts\n424->     * @param firstAudit\n425->     * @return\n426->     */\n427->    private String checkStatus(List<String> headerIdList,\n428->                               List<TmsLoanAccount> tmsLoanAccounts,\n429->                               boolean firstAudit) {\n430->        Optional<TmsLoanAccount> first = tmsLoanAccounts.stream().filter(\n431->                t -> LOAN_GL_APPROVE_STATUS_P.equals(t.getApproveStatus())).findFirst();\n432->        if (!first.isPresent()) {\n433->            return \"有凭证状态不符合审批要求，请确认后重试\";\n434->        }\n435->        //  初审校验所有状态（凭证头）都为审批(初审)中\n436->        //  复审校验所有状态（凭证头）都为复审中\n437->        List<Long> headerIds = headerIdList.stream().map(s -> Long.parseLong(s.trim())).collect(Collectors.toList());\n438->        TmsLoanAccountHeaderExample headerExample = new TmsLoanAccountHeaderExample();\n439->        TmsLoanAccountHeaderExample.Criteria criteria1 =\n440->                headerExample.createCriteria().andAccountHeaderIdIn(headerIds);\n441->        if (firstAudit) {\n442->            criteria1.andApproveStatusEqualTo(LOAN_GL_APPROVE_STATUS_P);\n443->        } else {\n444->            criteria1.andApproveStatusEqualTo(LOAN_GL_APPROVE_STATUS_REVIEW);\n445->        }\n446->        List<TmsLoanAccountHeader> headerList = loanAccountHeaderDAO.selectByExample(headerExample);\n447->        if (CollectionUtils.isEmpty(headerList) || headerIds.size() != headerList.size()) {\n448->            return \"凭证审批信息不存在或凭证状态不允许审批,请检查后重新审批\";\n449->        }\n450->        return null;\n451->    }\n452->\n453->    /**\n454->     * 初审通过（只修改凭证审核状态为复审中，增加审核记录，其余不变，走下一级审批）\n455->     *\n456->     * @param tmsLoanAccounts\n457->     * @param queryDTO\n458->     */\n459->    private void firstAudit(List<TmsLoanAccount> tmsLoanAccounts, ApproveFundVoucherQueryDTO queryDTO) {\n460->        if (CollectionUtils.isEmpty(tmsLoanAccounts)) {\n461->            return;\n462->        }\n463->        // 修改凭证头信息状态\n464->        Set<String> headerIdList = tmsLoanAccounts.stream()\n465->                .map(TmsLoanAccount::getAttribute3).collect(Collectors.toSet());\n466->        Map<String, List<TmsLoanAccount>> accountByHeaderId = tmsLoanAccounts.stream().collect(Collectors\n467->                .groupingBy(TmsLoanAccount::getAttribute3));\n468->        for (String id : headerIdList) {\n469->            List<TmsLoanAccount> accounts = accountByHeaderId.get(id);\n470->            TmsLoanAccountHeader header = new TmsLoanAccountHeader();\n471->            header.setAccountHeaderId(Long.valueOf(id));\n472->            header.setApproveStatus(LOAN_GL_APPROVE_STATUS_REVIEW);\n473->            loanAccountHeaderDAO.updateByPrimaryKeySelective(header);\n474->            header.setTrxType(accounts.get(0).getTrxType());\n475->            loanAccountService.saveAccountHis(header, EVENT_STATUS_PRE_APPROVED, queryDTO.getRemark());\n476->        }\n477->    }\n478->\n479->    /**\n480->     * 最终审核（审批完成、推送主库、回写原始单据审批完成状态）\n481->     * 1、初审即最终审核（初审对应的单据交易类型不在复审值集中）\n482->     * 2、复审\n483->     *\n484->     * @param tmsLoanAccounts\n485->     * @param queryDTO\n486->     * @param insertHisFlag\n487->     */\n488->    private void finalAudit(List<TmsLoanAccount> tmsLoanAccounts, ApproveFundVoucherQueryDTO queryDTO,\n489->                            boolean insertHisFlag) {\n490->        if (CollectionUtils.isEmpty(tmsLoanAccounts)) {\n491->            return;\n492->        }\n493->        List<Long> idList = tmsLoanAccounts.stream().map(TmsLoanAccount::getAccountId).collect(Collectors.toList());\n494->        Set<String> headerIdList = tmsLoanAccounts.stream()\n495->                .map(TmsLoanAccount::getAttribute3).collect(Collectors.toSet());\n496->\n497->        // 1、修改分录状态\n498->        TmsLoanAccountExample example = new TmsLoanAccountExample();\n499->        TmsLoanAccountExample.Criteria criteria = example.createCriteria();\n500->        criteria.andAccountIdIn(idList);\n501->        TmsLoanAccount tmsLoanAccount = new TmsLoanAccount();\n502->        tmsLoanAccount.setApproveStatus(LOAN_GL_APPROVE_STATUS_Y);\n503->        tmsLoanAccount.setAttribute1(SessionUtils.getSessionUser().getUsername()); // 审批人\n504->        tmsLoanAccount.setAttribute2(SessionUtils.getSessionUser().getUsername());\n505->        tmsLoanAccount.setLastUpdatedBy(SessionUtils.getSessionUser().getUsername());\n506->        tmsLoanAccount.setLastUpdateDate(new Date());\n507->        loanAccountDAO.updateByExampleSelective(tmsLoanAccount, example);\n508->\n509->        // 2、修改凭证头信息状态\n510->        Map<String, List<TmsLoanAccount>> accountByHeaderId = tmsLoanAccounts.stream().collect(Collectors\n511->                .groupingBy(TmsLoanAccount::getAttribute3));\n512->        for (String id : headerIdList) {\n513->            List<TmsLoanAccount> accounts = accountByHeaderId.get(id);\n514->            TmsLoanAccountHeader header = new TmsLoanAccountHeader();\n515->            header.setAccountHeaderId(Long.valueOf(id));\n516->            header.setApproveStatus(LOAN_GL_APPROVE_STATUS_Y);\n517->            loanAccountHeaderDAO.updateByPrimaryKeySelective(header);\n518->            header.setTrxType(accounts.get(0).getTrxType());\n519->            if (insertHisFlag) {\n520->                loanAccountService.saveAccountHis(header, EVENT_STATUS_APPROVED, queryDTO.getRemark());\n521->            }\n522->        }\n523->\n524->        // 3、审批后修改原始单据状态\n525->        Map<String, List<TmsLoanAccount>> loanMaps =\n526->                tmsLoanAccounts.stream().collect(Collectors.groupingBy(TmsLoanAccount::getApproveBatchId));\n527->        for (String batchId : loanMaps.keySet()) {\n528->            List<TmsLoanAccount> accounts = loanMaps.get(batchId);\n529->            if (CollectionUtils.isEmpty(accounts)) {\n530->                return;\n531->            }\n532->            this.handleSourceBillStatus(accounts, LOAN_GL_CREATED_STATUS_APPROVED);\n533->        }\n534->\n535->        // 4、推送主库\n536->        Map<String, List<TmsLoanAccount>> accountByBatchId = tmsLoanAccounts.stream().collect(Collectors\n537->                .groupingBy(TmsLoanAccount::getApproveBatchId));\n538->        accountByBatchId.entrySet().forEach(entry -> {\n539->            loanAccountService.sendLoanAccountToGLbyBSD(entry.getKey(), entry.getValue().size());\n540->        });\n541->    }\n542->\n543->    /**\n544->     * 更新原始单据状态为审批通过、审批拒绝（保存）\n545->     *\n546->     * @param tmsLoanAccounts\n547->     * @param status\n548->     */\n549->    private void handleSourceBillStatus(List<TmsLoanAccount> tmsLoanAccounts, String status) {\n550->        if (CollectionUtils.isEmpty(tmsLoanAccounts)) {\n551->            return;\n552->        }\n553->        switch (tmsLoanAccounts.get(0).getTrxCategory()) {\n554->\n555->            case CFT:\n556->                // fall through to case IFT\n557->            case IFT:\n558->                // 修改划拨单分录状态\n559->                fundTransferService.updateApproveStatus(tmsLoanAccounts.get(0).getEventId(), status);\n560->                break;\n561->            case DEAL_TYPE_TERMDEPOSIT:\n562->                // fall through to case DEAL_TYPE_CURRFINANCING\n563->            case DEAL_TYPE_NOTICEDEPOSIT:\n564->                // fall through to case DEAL_TYPE_CURRFINANCING\n565->            case DEAL_TYPE_TERMFINANCING:\n566->                // fall through to case DEAL_TYPE_CURRFINANCING\n567->            case DEAL_TYPE_CURRFINANCING:\n568->            case DEAL_TYPE_BANKLOAN:\n569->            case BILLFINANCING:\n570->            case DEAL_TYPE_MONEYMARKET:\n571->                // 修改投资理财分录状态（区分交易事件+计提利息）\n572->                if (LoanConstants.LOAN_ACCOUNT_TYPE_TRX.equals(tmsLoanAccounts.get(0).getAccountType())) {\n573->                    DealEventProcessDTO dto = new DealEventProcessDTO();\n574->                    List<Long> eventIds = tmsLoanAccounts.stream().map(TmsLoanAccount::getEventId)\n575->                            .collect(Collectors.toList())\n576->                            .stream().distinct().collect(Collectors.toList());\n577->                    eventIds.forEach(id -> {\n578->                        dto.setAccountingStatus(status);\n579->                        dto.setEventId(id);\n580->                        // 更新理财交易事件分录状态  已提交\n581->                        processService.updateAccountingStatus(dto);\n582->                    });\n583->                }\n584->                // 如果是重分类事件，则更新interestAccrualService\n585->                if (LoanConstants.TMS_DEAL_ACCEVENTTYPE_A07.equals(tmsLoanAccounts.get(0).getEventType())) {\n586->                    // 投资理财计提利息\n587->                    DealInterestAccrualDTO dto = new DealInterestAccrualDTO();\n588->                    dto.setAccountStatus(status);\n589->                    dto.setAccrualId(tmsLoanAccounts.get(0).getAccrualId());\n590->                    interestAccrualService.updateAccountingStatus(dto);\n591->                }\n592->                break;\n593->            case DEAL_INTEREST_ACCRUAL:\n594->                // 投资理财计提利息\n595->                DealInterestAccrualDTO dto = new DealInterestAccrualDTO();\n596->                dto.setAccountStatus(status);\n597->                dto.setAccrualId(tmsLoanAccounts.get(0).getAccrualId());\n598->                interestAccrualService.updateAccountingStatus(dto);\n599->                break;\n600->            case DIRECT_LOAN:\n601->                // 修改公司间借款分录状态（区分交易事件+计提利息）\n602->                if (LoanConstants.LOAN_ACCOUNT_TYPE_TRX.equals(tmsLoanAccounts.get(0).getAccountType())) {\n603->                    // 更新公司间借款交易事件状态\n604->                    LoanEventDTO eventDTO = new LoanEventDTO();\n605->                    List<Long> eventIds = tmsLoanAccounts.stream().map(TmsLoanAccount::getEventId)\n606->                            .collect(Collectors.toList())\n607->                            .stream().distinct().collect(Collectors.toList());\n608->                    eventIds.forEach(id -> {\n609->                        eventDTO.setAccountStatus(status);\n610->                        eventDTO.setEventId(id);\n611->                        // 更新公司间借款交易事件分录状态  已提交\n612->                        loanEventConfirmService.updateAccountingStatus(eventDTO);\n613->                    });\n614->                }\n615->     