W()\n    WHERE account_id IN\n    <foreach collection=\"accountIds\" item=\"id\" open=\"(\" separator=\",\" close=\")\">\n        #{id}\n    </foreach>\n</update>\n```\n\n## 📊 预期性能对比\n\n| 操作类型       | 当前耗时 | 优化后预期 | 提升幅度 |\n|----------------|----------|------------|----------|\n| 主查询         | 149ms    | 50ms       | 66%      |\n| 状态校验       | 28ms     | 5ms        | 82%      |\n| 批量更新       | 131ms    | 30ms       | 77%      |\n| **总耗时**     | **308ms**| **85ms**   | **72%**  |\n\n## 🔧 实施步骤建议\n\n1. **先实现DAO层批量方法**：\n   ```xml\n   <!-- 在LoanAccountDAO.xml中添加 -->\n   <select id=\"selectByHeaderIds\" resultMap=\"BaseResultMap\">...</select>\n   <update id=\"batchUpdateStatus\">...</update>\n   ```\n\n2. **重构服务层逻辑**：\n   ```java\n   public void afterBpmCompleteActivity(ApproveFundVoucherQueryDTO queryDTO, boolean firstAudit) {\n       // 1. 批量查询\n       List<Long> headerIds = Collections.singletonList(queryDTO.getAccountHeaderId());\n       Map<Long, List<TmsLoanAccount>> accountMap = loanAccountDAO.selectByHeaderIds(headerIds);\n       \n       // 2. 合并校验\n       boolean isValid = accountMap.get(queryDTO.getAccountHeaderId()).stream()\n           .allMatch(acc -> validateStatus(acc, firstAudit));\n       \n       // 3. 批量操作\n       if (isValid) {\n           List<Long> accountIds = accountMap.values().stream()\n               .flatMap(List::stream)\n               .map(TmsLoanAccount::getAccountId)\n               .collect(Collectors.toList());\n               \n           loanAccountDAO.batchUpdateStatus(accountIds, \n               firstAudit ? \"A\" : \"F\", \n               SecurityUtils.getCurrentUser());\n       }\n   }\n   ```\n\n需要我为您实现上述任何一个具体优化步骤吗？或者您希望先看到哪个部分的详细代码？",
