g unexecuted tasks: {}\", remainingTasks.size());\n}\n```\n\n#### **2. 动态参数调整**\n```java\n// 运行时线程池参数调整\npublic static void setCorePoolSize(ThreadPoolExecutor executor, int corePoolSize) {\n    executor.setCorePoolSize(corePoolSize);\n    log.info(\"Thread pool core size adjusted to: {}\", corePoolSize);\n}\n```\n\n#### **3. 批量任务支持**\n```java\n// 原生批量方法也支持MDC注入\npublic <T> List<Future<T>> invokeAll(Collection<? extends Callable<T>> tasks) {\n    List<Callable<T>> wrappedTasks = tasks.stream()\n        .map(task -> wrapCallable(task, \"batch-task-\" + TASK_ID_GENERATOR.incrementAndGet()))\n        .collect(Collectors.toList());\n    return target.invokeAll(wrappedTasks);\n}\n```\n\n### **🛡️ 安全与稳定性保障**\n\n#### **1. 参数校验**\n```java\n// 创建时的严格参数校验\nif (corePoolSize < 0 || maxPoolSize <= 0 || maxPoolSize < corePoolSize || queue == null) {\n    throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"Invalid thread pool parameters\");\n}\n```\n\n#### **2. 异常隔离**\n```java\n// Error级异常单独处理，避免线程池崩溃\nif (t instanceof Error) {\n    log.error(\"Task [{}] encountered critical error, thread may be terminated\", taskName);\n}\n```\n\n#### **3. 资源管理**\n```java\n// JVM关闭钩子确保资源释放\nRuntime.getRuntime().addShutdownHook(new Thread(() -> {\n    shutdownAndAwaitTermination(wrappedDefaultExecutor, 30, TimeUnit.SECONDS);\n}));\n```\n\n### **📊 使用体验改进**\n\n#### **1. 简化的API设计**\n```java\n// 多种便捷的提交方式\nsubmit(task, \"自定义任务名\");                    // 自定义命名\nsubmitWithTimeout(task, \"任务名\", 30, SECONDS); // 带超时控制\nexecute(runnable, \"异步任务\");                  // Runnable简化版\n```\n\n#### **2. 丰富的监控信息**\n```java\n// 详细的线程池状态输出\nThreadPool [DefaultThreadPool] Status: \nCore=10, Pool=15, Active=8, Largest=20, \nTaskCount=1500, Completed=1492, \nQueueSize=80/1000, QueueUsage=8.0%, \nShutdown=false, Terminating=false, Terminated=false\n```\n\n### **🎯 总结**\n\n**NewThreadPoolExecutorUtil 从根本上解决了旧框架的核心痛点**：\n\n- ✅ **从僵化到灵活**：支持动态配置和运行时调整\n- ✅ **从监控缺失到全方位监控**：内置状态监控和预警机制  \n- ✅ **从风险隐藏到风险暴露**：完善的异常处理和日志追踪\n- ✅ **从使用混乱到规范统一**：